pace","subtitle":"First floor, DeLaMare Science and Engineering Library","notes":"Take Makerspace 101 before planning a build, then use the 3D printing, scanning, cutting, milling, sewing, and hand-tool resources for a project.","short_summary":"A student makerspace supporting fabrication and project work with training required for users.","evidence_claim":"The DeLaMare FAQ says the Makerspace is open and free for all students and offers fabrication equipment; users must take Makerspace 101.","source_url":"https://library.unr.edu/help/common-questions/delamare-library-faq","source_title":"DeLaMare Library FAQ | University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open and free for students; complete the required Makerspace 101 Training Course before using the space.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unr-mary-b-ansari-map-library","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Mary B. Ansari Map Library","title":"Mary B. Ansari Map Library","subtitle":"Basement, DeLaMare Science and Engineering Library","notes":"Use this named collection when a project calls for maps or geospatial context; locate it through DeLaMare’s basement floor map before heading over.","short_summary":"A Nevada map collection within DeLaMare Library, alongside data and GIS support.","evidence_claim":"University Libraries says the Mary B. Ansari Map Library contains more than 140,000 maps, and its floor map places it in DeLaMare's basement.","source_url":"https://library.unr.edu/places/directions/delamare-library-floor-maps","source_title":"DeLaMare Library floor maps | University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located at the south end of DeLaMare's basement floor; check library access information before visi